{
  "bookId": "hero-212001",
  "id": "bond-29312",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29312001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "新的一天开始啦，今天也要火力全开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "话说，为什么尤娜的鞋带总是不绑起来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "原因很简单，因为——我不会绑鞋带！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "打绑带之类的太麻烦了，一般都是里惠在帮我做。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不绑鞋带的话会容易绊倒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这点小困难，就用毅力去克服吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真拿你没办法，这样，我有一个提议。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29312010",
              "text": "我来帮帮你吧。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29312010",
              "text": "我来教教你吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29312009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "喔，没问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这样……这样……我的手有点大，不过也不算太难。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "啊，和妹妹给我绑鞋带的感觉完全不一样诶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29312015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "主人，谢谢你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
